!notes/README.md
# Everything under processed/ is derived and reproducible: the DuckDB catalog, the
# draft board, and the Hive tree hub.store writes. It is also redistributed
# third-party data, which the repo cannot publish. Regenerate with `make draft` and
# `hub.fetch.nflverse --refresh`.
data/processed/
outputs/

# The live overlay is generated at deploy time, not committed -- ADR-0018. A live score is
# someone else's fact, checkable against ESPN at the time, so pinning it to a commit proves
# nothing and costs the record its readability: seventy-two commits a Sunday into a history
# that *is* the pre-registration. Committing it also guaranteed the staleness the watchdog
# reports, because the deployed page could only ever show whatever was last committed.
site/data/live.json
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Personal Claude Code overrides -- machine-local, never shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
